// RFC-0097 §3: overlap between two bare-parameter blankets of the same local aspect
// needs no new machinery -- it is caught by the same overlap detection RFC-0060 §2
// already uses for named targets. `Copy` implies `Clone` (RFC-0080), so any `T: Copy`
// also satisfies `T: Clone`, and these two blankets are not syntactically disjoint.

aspect Marker {}

extend<T: Copy> T: Marker {}
extend<T: Clone> T: Marker {}

fun main() {}
